# Reference copy. The live block is in the scramble challenge repo's edge/Caddyfile, whose
# Caddy container (its own standalone "caddy" stack) owns ports 80 and 443 on the shared VM.
# Add it there, then validate and reload (docs/runbook.md). The upstream is the web service's
# alias on the shared edge network.
wca-records-analyser.duckdns.org {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy wca-records-analyser:8000
}
